          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"finland-conformance-inline-walkthrough\">Finland conformance \u2014 inline walkthrough</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The <strong>whole pipeline in one place</strong>, with every step written out in cells \u2014\nno <code>conformance</code> package imports. Downloads a small live sample straight into\nmemory (the production notebook persists raw to S3 first), then:</span>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>prh_ytj JSONL \u2192 structured</strong> with native Polars</li>\n<li><strong>prh_xbrl XML \u2192 facts</strong> with an inline lxml parser</li>\n<li><strong>build the 4 canonical tables</strong> (<code>registrations</code>, <code>company</code>, <code>financials</code>, <code>company_websites</code>)</li>\n<li><strong>validate + write Parquet</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The other 4 canonical tables (<code>persons</code>, <code>company_people</code>, <code>company_contacts</code>,\n<code>company_relationships</code>) are <em>known-absent</em> in Finland open data.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
