          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"2-prh_ytj-jsonl-structured-native-polars\">2. prh_ytj JSONL \u2192 structured (native Polars)</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><code>pl.read_ndjson</code> reads the JSONL into nested struct/list columns; we reshape\nwith vectorized expressions. Domain rules are expressed inline: liveness from\n<code>tradeRegisterStatus</code>/<code>endDate</code> (never the constant <code>status</code> field), current\nprimary name = <code>type==1 &amp; endDate null</code>, URL normalization, lowercased host.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
