    {
      "id": "SFPL",
      "code_hash": "bf01b577b315908f4102549bc89a985d",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"3-prh_xbrl-xml-facts-inline-lxml-parser\">3. prh_xbrl XML \u2192 facts (inline lxml parser)</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">XML is not tabular, so this is a real parser (not Polars). Each fact is an\n<code>fi_met:*</code> element whose financial-statement line item lives in the referenced\ncontext as an <code>fi_dim:MCY</code> member; <code>fi_dim:REF</code> marks current vs prior period.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
