          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"4-build-the-canonical-tables\">4. Build the canonical tables</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><code>company_uid</code> = <code>\"c:\" + sha1(\"FI:\" + business_id)</code> (no LEI in YTJ open data);\n<code>registration_uid</code> = <code>\"FI:\" + business_id</code>. We compute them once over the\nunique business ids and join them in (Polars has no native sha1).</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
